  "@type": [
    "schema:Dataset"
  ],
  "schema:name": "Lobbyist Reporting History",
  "schema:description": "This dataset contains a list of lobbyist reports:  Lobbyist/Client/Contract Registration (L1), Lobbyist Monthly Expenditure Report (L2), Lobbyist Client's Annual Report (L3), Lobbyist Employer Contributions (L3C), Lobbying by State and Local Government Agencies (L5) including reports that have been superseded by an amendment.\n\nData Coverage and Limitations: The data set covers that prior 16 years plus the current election year. Pre-2016 records are available in separate \"Pre-2016 Lobbyist Compensation and Expenses by Source\" and “Pre-2016 Lobbyist Employment Registrations” datasets. This is a best-effort compilation that may contain incomplete or incorrect information. Original reports remain accessible for record verification.\n\nDescriptions attached to this dataset do not constitute legal definitions; please consult RCW 42.17A and WAC Title 390 for legal definitions and additional information regarding political finance disclosure requirements.\n\nCONDITION OF RELEASE: This publication constitutes a list of individuals prepared by the Washington State Public Disclosure Commission and may not be used for commercial purposes. This list is provided on the condition and with the understanding that the persons receiving it agree to this statutorily imposed limitation on its use. See\nRCW 42.56.070(9) and AGO 1975 No. 15.",
  "schema:identifier": "nuwx-ay5h",
  "schema:keywords": [
    "lobbying",
    "lobbyist",
    "political finance",
    "disclosure",
    "expense reports",
